e marked (set at run time, PY5d)"] [83 1 "// Instr is an instruction: the operation and its argument decoded into two integers (§7.2's table:"] [84 1 "// an index, a count, a jump target, an operator, a flag ...)."] [90 1 "// Handler is a row of the exception table: instructions [Start, End) go to Target with the stack"] [91 1 "// popped to Depth, then the instruction's index pushed when Lasti, then the exception."] [97 1 "// Make-function's parts (the IR's [CONST PARTS]), as a bit set in B."] [105 1 "// Intrinsic is the IR's :call-intrinsic NAME (§3.4)."] [126 1 "// handlerAt is the handler covering instruction pc, or nil."] [137 1 "// Line is instruction pc's line, 0 when unknown."] [145 1 "// OpNames is the IR's operations the loader knows, in Op order (bin/pyi runtime check compares them"] [146 1 "// with arbace.python.ir/ops)."] [149 1 "// OpOwners is each operation's owner (PYI-SPEC.md §9), in Op order."] [152 1 "// SetFilename sets the code object's co_filename and its nested code objects'."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[156 31]] :go/trails [[123 75]]} (go/file "code.go" :imports [])



